        <mxCell id="n1" value="WHAT THE SYSTEM RECORDS AT EVERY STEP (AR-01, AR-04)&#10;Request ID, requester, contact, reference, destination, summary; current status; the staff member who set it and the time; and the clarification history. Statuses used here: AWAITING CLARIFICATION, READY, IN DELIVERY, RECEIVED." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="1030" width="760" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n2" value="ROLE-LIMITED INFORMATION (AR-05)&#10;The desk holds the requester's contact details. The runner view shows request ID, reference, destination and delivery status only, and omits contact details. The keeper sees the request and records acknowledgment." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="860" y="1030" width="700" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n3" value="CORRECTION IS ADDITIVE, NOT A REPLACEMENT (AR-04)&#10;In E01 the original entry keeps reference CK-099 and a blank destination. The correction to CK-042 and East Records is added as a new entry in the clarification history with its own author and time, so a reviewer can see both the original issue and the corrected values." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1600" y="1030" width="780" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n4" value="PROPOSAL ONLY&#10;This is a proposed route for review by Iona Venn and the Archive Council. It is not an approved or implemented service. No error rate, service time or cost saving is claimed, because no baseline was supplied (W09-S01, W09-S04)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2420" y="1030" width="700" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
